dist-[a-c]
dist-p[0-9]
dist-q[0-9]

# Raw render inputs for the hero plate: scanned models, PBR sets and the light
# probe, about 17 MB. They are build inputs, not site assets, and nothing on
# the site loads them: the only shipped artefact is public/brand/hero-plate-*.
# Left in public/ because the render scripts expect them there, but kept out of
# the repo so they are not deployed. Re-fetch with:
#   python3 scripts/fetch-hero-assets.py && python3 scripts/optimise-hero-assets.py
public/hero3d/**
!public/hero3d/ASSET-LICENCES.md
!public/hero3d/CREDITS.json
__pycache__/
